OL,3,GNEWSAThe town debating its support for
OL,4,Aasylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs plans for asylum accommodation for
OL,7,Fmore than 1,000 people have been
OL,8,Fapproved in Piddington, Oxfordshire,
OL,9,FSwindon councillors are resisting any
OL,10,Fsimilar move there.
OL,12,FFor more than two decades, the town has
OL,13,Fbeen the designated first "dispersal
OL,14,Ftown" in Wiltshire for refugees.
OL,16,FCouncillor Sara Godwin, leader of
OL,17,FReform UK Swindon, launched a motion
OL,18,Fcalling on the government to consult
OL,19,Fwith Swindon Borough Council before
OL,20,Fimposing a significant increase in
OL,21,Fasylum seekers coming to the area.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
