OL,3,GNEWSAThe town debating its support for
OL,4,Aasylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of asylum seekers coming to
OL,7,FWiltshire has been falling in recent
OL,8,Fyears, and there is no proposed change
OL,9,Fto the number coming to Swindon. Labour
OL,10,Fcouncillors said Reform's move
OL,11,F"demonises" people.
